{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "70eb6ba0894e0dd112b8d70989218817dd42eb5223dba3a46f054de390513b42", "ja": "＜テキスト非表示＞", "zh": "＜不显示文本＞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1001_null", "source_sha256": "f9dca90de67f6f10e4a9a69730d1f56798f54ef6908ae491d86dc4b62b50f386", "ja": "デビューより数日後……", "zh": "出道几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "489a4a13a6af257ce4178670c019ef0e70695865a3974bb2ad229c6a74f77801", "ja": "おはようございます！　なんて。\nふふっ、さすがに誰もいないよね。", "zh": "早上好！……什么的。\n呵呵，果然还是一个人都没有吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "0d6159552088dc1db67886ebc6d88ff79dc613e84e881788fc40868a3e385c90", "ja": "ミーティングはお昼からなのに、まだ朝だもん。\n自主レッスンでもしてようかな……。", "zh": "明明会议是从中午开始，现在还只是早上嘛。\n要不要先自主练习一下呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "dba3332368487505a0b8d2a5991323d7ba98945eeaaf10e8c7c268b8e7c876b3", "ja": "おはよう、紗代子さん！", "zh": "早上好，纱代子姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "38c27538f16e33e78dd4eb9c0e3446ebc2e836f57f5bddbaf7d120aef062dab8", "ja": "おはようございます！\nわぁ、Team5th、そろっちゃいました♪", "zh": "早上好！\n哇，Team5th全员到齐了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "bb8143d1ca92c12821f563b1c43aba83d7894eb1ce95f131dc2fe9188518b2b2", "ja": "育ちゃん、星梨花ちゃん！　美也さんも茜ちゃんも……\nみんな、どうしたの？", "zh": "育、星梨花！美也还有小茜……大家这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "e95e11717033436577f184cea3a9e8dfb8b4f987ea939ec607ca67c8f67c52f0", "ja": "むふふ～。紗代子ちゃんは、どうしたんですか～？", "zh": "呵呵呵～。那纱代子又是怎么了呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "b41261e0a7c18c8b34b7147e15831bad3d9c65a50e8e28cdea5f3a9da0060a06", "ja": "私は……。今日はすごく早く目が覚めちゃって。\nずっとソワソワして、落ち着かなくて……。", "zh": "我……今天醒得特别早。一直坐立不安，静不下心来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "c0fa117ece2bd7e63cd674eb16544ad916c41523c7858c830f942a140c27ff9d", "ja": "ランニングしたら、ますます落ち着かなくなって……\nそれならと思って、劇場まで来ちゃったの。", "zh": "跑了步之后，反而更静不下心来……\n于是想着既然这样，就不知不觉跑到剧场来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "fdfac4071e2e0b88c9e00761b597e2ab535d7e32e1efbe6974094d46c1bfacc9", "ja": "わかる、わかるよ！　いよいよ全世界待望の、\nTeam5thのアイドル活動、本格始動だからね！", "zh": "我懂，我懂！毕竟全世界都翘首以盼的Team5th偶像活动，终于要正式启动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "a8c0b51c4b7fb73c8bee7604e870b5e7719ce615c612d083e37c0b9b5ee4e165", "ja": "みんな落ち着かないのも無理ない話……。\nそれを一番楽しみにしてたのが、この5人なわけだし♪", "zh": "大家静不下心来也很正常……毕竟，最期待这件事的就是这5个人嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "70f06ca426cc4d9d5bc759bb7031fc9d49246eed7dee5756c0a4f4643bc2f067", "ja": "あ、それじゃあみんなも……？\nそうだったんだ♪", "zh": "啊，那就是说大家也……？\n原来是这样啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "ce122163d6aada36fbec47be01a808a47692719ce0e39fe9e21f564226f547bb", "ja": "トラブルに愛されたデビューイベントを乗り越え、\n既に茜ちゃん達、Team5thの息はぴったりなのだー！", "zh": "闯过了麻烦不断的出道活动，小茜们和Team5th已经配合得天衣无缝啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "7b6406d19ec7e41f1a94ec0b26f7015ffe39b14fb4fe33c1e786bc990945199f", "ja": "あの時は大変でしたね～。まさか、\n渋滞でCDの到着が遅れるとは思いませんでした～。", "zh": "那时真是好不容易呢～。真没想到，\nCD会因为堵车而迟迟送不到呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "b0f701dcd5c5ab15e687c35da22e52817efd3c3c5e12c6e8617170f78879eeea", "ja": "茜さんのおしゃべりとか、育ちゃんとのダンスでお客さ\nんを引き留めたりして……思い出すとドキドキします！", "zh": "靠茜小姐的聊天、还有和育一起跳舞来留住客人……每次回想起来心跳都会加速！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "0504619403cf632b424bd5e60e6de5c5bffc8fb2e1143172872226f70516ded8", "ja": "最後のじゃんけん大会も、すっごく盛り上がったよね！", "zh": "最后的猜拳大赛，也超级热闹吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "c1a556cce5cc320a4fa6a16e8ce5004d8f4810d53c2a3992f81ed0924b6a304f", "ja": "うん！　あのデビューイベントの成功は、\nチーム全員で頑張ったからだと思う！", "zh": "嗯！我觉得，那场出道活动能成功，\n是因为整个团队一起努力的结果！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1018_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "bd23fc3360f71460c32f5ef1e77794811d1b61863b63f7dd21b2212fee8174fe", "ja": "それで、今日のミーティングの後に、\n青羽さんには次の衣装の……あれ？　みんな？", "zh": "所以，今天的会议结束后，要和青羽小姐商量下一套服装的……咦？大家？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "b578e324468235fbe4051090c5580d0eb07601770bc21fc1acb94d8ea9a21655", "ja": "おはようございます！", "zh": "早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "368f534271344572200115e6ebc7c301152bfcdaafe0cd8fe0d957e9ead3fdac", "ja": "おはようございます♪", "zh": "早上好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "b578e324468235fbe4051090c5580d0eb07601770bc21fc1acb94d8ea9a21655", "ja": "おはようございます！", "zh": "早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "a37162f20ad7c745654c6a8bd3dc7d211b7c11de1ed82649a9407f5b98ab220c", "ja": "おはようございます～。", "zh": "早安～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "858b2ab37af57939352a7a35c5f4e753e04f371f29581421d3ff9af1e0b6cf74", "ja": "おはようございま～す！", "zh": "早安～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "5aa3cf31c5b969af7ddc4c5acfa773f9cc12b82e97871d075a39507cb8694530", "ja": "お、おはよう。\nTeam5th、もう揃ってたのか……。", "zh": "早、早上好。Team5th，已经都到齐了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1026_102mis", "source_sha256": "8f39f32526ad7b26bb1cc5e59b227edcfab349dc52dcc2e0f37b85ce4399aeea", "ja": "おはようございます♪　みんな。もしかして……今日の\nミーティングが楽しみで待ちきれなかったのかな？", "zh": "早上好♪大家。难道说……是因为期待今天的会议，已经等不及了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "77df06ceeddc5e36230e7cfcb846cc6fcf6e7856390234b1291bce8322a55394", "ja": "そうなんです♪\nあ！　もしかして、ダメでしたか？", "zh": "就是这样♪  \n啊！难道……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1028_401pro", "source_sha256": "59d340b7f46212a13d5b50c17c7059b0ee1f2f0de21bb0e05f84cf40f2751f2c", "ja": "とんでもない。自由に来てくれて構わないよ。\nここは、みんなの活動拠点だからな！", "zh": "没那回事。随时过来都没关系。\n这里可是大家活动的据点啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1029_102mis", "source_sha256": "811034d53fea07b13c4be8a287086ea2f0fbb99b8ef0eb6364f9a70eda03e747", "ja": "プロデューサーさん。少し早いですけど、\nミーティングを始めちゃいませんか？", "zh": "制作人。虽然还早了点，要不要现在就开始会议？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1030_102mis", "source_sha256": "4e7c39e53ea23e172cb8d42ba69a2511312d28e56ed19a3bf581384e29b9a88a", "ja": "よかったら、私も同席させてもらえたらなって。\n衣装づくりの参考にもなると思うんです♪", "zh": "如果不介意的话，我也想一起参加。\n感觉对制作服装也能起到参考作用呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "7cf6a0a66f5741f99825d4b9971db8743e5593a8325fa2d04f322a1708fafa98", "ja": "そうですね！　みんな待ちきれないみたいだし、\n予定より早いけど、始めましょうか。", "zh": "是啊！大家好像都等不及了，\n虽然比计划提前了一点，但我们开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1032_401pro", "source_sha256": "6eee7cba6e5ce2140930ab88c617c140f1b65635a6cc45f71433b7c44b8f9d20", "ja": "早速だけど……地方局の朝の情報番組、\n『地元からオハヨー！』に、みんなの出演が決定した！", "zh": "虽然有点突然……不过大家已经确定要参加地方电视台的早间资讯节目《早安，来自家乡！》了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1033_027say", "source_sha256": "263c25674f7e2c539a78287d1ed69d101930b646773e366e85ce96107bdced2f", "ja": "朝の、情報番組……！", "zh": "早上的……资讯节目……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1034_401pro", "source_sha256": "463b20afece91ac4865a81202fe621d7615a8cdeb0d853f2b926acefbd78e116", "ja": "番組の中では、一人ずつスポットでコーナーを\n担当してもらうことになる。やりがいがあるぞ！", "zh": "在节目中，大家要分别负责一个聚焦个人的环节。很有干劲哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1035_102mis", "source_sha256": "30c8b28ff2c131c6b24616c39c289b45ce8c4d0e8236f523f8579b3e98e227be", "ja": "みんな、おめでとう～！　……あれ？　朝の情報\n番組ってことは……。もしかして、生出演！？", "zh": "大家，恭喜你们～！……咦？早间资讯\n节目的话……难道说是现场直播出演！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1036_401pro", "source_sha256": "8f627a96501bb666a9393e0fb5360cbab87c3f3f8ca982a9f5a00f6fab4b3c23", "ja": "はい、そうなります。まあ、この様子だと\nみんな朝寝坊の心配はいらないかな！", "zh": "是的，就是这样。看大家这个样子，应该不用担心睡过头了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1037_030iku", "source_sha256": "304360fae93e09eb80be527888c6a3994fde215686c2c36e1344457f34a7f347", "ja": "もちろんだよ、プロデューサーさん！　わたし、今日は\nおかあさんに起こしてもらう前に起きたんだから！", "zh": "当然啦，制作人！我今天可是赶在妈妈叫我起床之前就自己醒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1038_022ser", "source_sha256": "2a67d2aa80c25d2d7fdd93622bc406b41ee6b1285fcaab783c123288069bbfba", "ja": "わたしも毎朝ジュニオールの散歩をしていますから、\n平気です♪", "zh": "我也每天早上都会带朱尼奥去散步，\n所以没问题的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1039_102mis", "source_sha256": "034afe15e843fc29565999db5a2df9445c5d3d521cfff9093e7cf99cf0e0fcce", "ja": "ふふっ、ふたりとも頼もしいなぁ♪　朝……爽やかな\n空気……うん、なんだかイメージが湧いてきたかも♪", "zh": "呵呵，两位都很可靠呢♪　早晨……清新的空气……嗯，好像渐渐有画面了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "11caf2717765e90863ebf4e5db1516e20e2873ce82a6812a3ea86077fd5e9d44", "ja": "どんなコーナーを担当するかも気になるよね！\n茜ちゃん、インタビューとか超得意な方だよ！", "zh": "负责什么环节也很让人在意呢！\n小茜可是特别擅长采访之类的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1041_042miy", "source_sha256": "d739fec5f7a471574ab3359f0609106f456f612e6520281947e10858370ed8fd", "ja": "朝の番組にはいろんなコーナーがありますからね～。\nこれは楽しみですな～♪", "zh": "早间节目里有好多不同的环节呢～。\n真是让人期待呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1042_401pro", "source_sha256": "32da0ff4b002c135589f482cf3e4a0d5e93ba257c8b72428040d9e4eef17094c", "ja": "それともうひとつ、大事なことがある。番組の最後には\nみんなにライブを披露してもらうからな！", "zh": "还有一件重要的事。节目最后要让大家为观众献上现场演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1043_027say", "source_sha256": "39d437e4e12ee0ce8cae2eff04df6da9c1cb9dcee9cd0150ffd2f8ab4b34716a", "ja": "ライブ……！\n私たちの曲、歌わせてもらえるんですね！", "zh": "演唱会……！\n我们可以唱自己的歌了，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1044_401pro", "source_sha256": "0a0db40d05b9896e177c6a64690125f0a449d409c49d447e9d1d5d8992989b96", "ja": "ああ、しかも出演からしばらくの間、\n番組のエンディング曲に使ってもらえるんだ。", "zh": "啊，而且在出演后的一段时间里，还会作为节目的片尾曲播放。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1045_401pro", "source_sha256": "7d66992373ddbf18304a8044eccbaf6859f9a82e2bce82accbbd732091d4b8a3", "ja": "朝の爽やかさと、背中を押してくれるイメージが\nピッタリ、だそうだ。やったな！", "zh": "说是早晨的清爽感，还有那种给人鼓劲的感觉\n非常契合。太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1046_027say", "source_sha256": "0d449194e95cc605e111174826974cb5f82c3ff57889458fa816b0e7245d817d", "ja": "背中を押して……、そうですよね。\n仕事や学校に行く人に、一日の元気を届けなきゃ……！", "zh": "给人向前的力量……对，就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1047_027say", "source_sha256": "c0aa7f373d581def6a9f501b9b462301cf37e93814ef0daadba7ca898ea8a3a4", "ja": "プロデューサー、素敵なお仕事ありがとうございます！\n期待に応えられるよう、私達、全身全霊で頑張ります！", "zh": "制作人，谢谢您为我们安排这么棒的工作！\n为了不辜负您的期待，我们会竭尽全力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_intro_1048_401pro", "source_sha256": "71b7bb482c79c95443df614965db7d0d1d6357309b4e0b71f5fd922641ed2a3d", "ja": "うん、よろしく頼むぞ！\nTeam5thで、最高の朝を届けよう！", "zh": "嗯，拜托你们了！\n用Team5th，送上最棒的早晨吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
